<mxCell id="note" value="Shown: every attribute of every class and every method of Code v1. Not shown: constructors, plain getters and setters, small private helper methods. Filled diamond = owns (composition); empty diamond = uses objects that another class owns (aggregation); open arrow = has a reference to (association); dashed arrow = uses / creates for a moment (dependency). + public, - private, underlined = static." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="708.6" y="199.5" width="517.2" height="237.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
